# Character Sheet Studio — your settings
#
# 1. Get an API key at https://wavespeed.ai/?ref=matrix (Account -> Access keys).
# 2. Paste it after the = sign below. No quotes, no spaces.
# 3. Open this folder in the Claude Code desktop app and say: Create my character sheet.
#
# This file stays on your machine. Never share this folder with the key filled in.

WAVESPEED_API_KEY=

# Optional: which image model to use. Leave empty for the default (gpt-image-2).
# Options: gpt-image-2 · nano-banana-pro · nano-banana-2 · seedream · seedream-v5-pro
MODEL=
